#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: advanced.ui:32
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>If this option is enabled, a shaded window will unshade automatically when the mouse pointer has been over the titlebar for some time.</p>"
"</body></html>"
